Subject: [PATCH 02244/11362] [conductor] PHASE F1 (OFF-ARC EXECUTION-VERIFIER
 TRANSFER; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT; known-issues MANDATORY 2026-06-11;
 decentralization) -- run the GAP-4 execution primitive (induce program from
 demos -> restricted-exec -> demo-fit selection) OFF-ARC on MBPP/EvalPlus,
 ACCUMULATING to power. The GAP-4 rule-execution verifier is domain-general BY
 CONSTRUCTION (induce program -> exec -> exact-output-match) but its off-ARC
 transfer is UNDER-MEASURED: exp4032 found no off-ARC transfer (delta_pp=5.0,
 CI95 [0.0,12.5] incl 0) at low n; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT is OPEN. Map: visible
 tests = demos (the induction signal), hidden tests = gold (the held-out
 target). Two arms: vote@1 (majority candidate) vs demo-fit selection (the
 candidate whose induced program passes the visible/demo tests).
 Decentralization: local SOTA GGUF generator (gemma-4-12B-it -- many
 candidates per task, fast), model-free execution verifier.
 ACCUMULATE-not-restart (memory powering-run-background-mechanism-fails +
 known-issues 'powering runs must accumulate'): resume the
 exp4032/exp4051/exp4063 EvalPlus checkpoint (corpus+model keyed, NOT exp-id
 keyed) and EXTEND n; report ACCUMULATED-N with a bootstrap CI. Gate: demo-fit
 selection earns held-out (hidden-test) headroom over vote (the ARC-1 analog:
 vote 0.4516 -> gated 0.5806). Emit off_arc_demofit_beats_vote BARE bool :=
 (hidden-test demo-fit - vote > 0 AND CI95-excl-0). Execution-grounded =>
 verifier_is_oracle=true (HONEST: the cheap/automatic/decentralized execution
 layer, NOT the oracle-distinct moat). HARD FLOOR: if accumulated n added < a
 real increment for this window AND the CI still includes 0, LOG the gap +
 flag for the 3-consecutive-window auto-retire check.

Automated research step by research conductor.
Task ID: exp4319-off-arc-execution-verifier-transfer-accumulate

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
